  "stem": "<p>If <math alttext=\"2 x plus 3 equals 9\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, what is the value of <math alttext=\"6 x minus 1\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
